 829:FreeRTOS/src/tasks.c ****             *
 830:FreeRTOS/src/tasks.c ****             * This is slightly complicated since we need to save and restore
 831:FreeRTOS/src/tasks.c ****             * the suspension and critical nesting counts, as well as release
 832:FreeRTOS/src/tasks.c ****             * and reacquire the correct locks. And then, do it all over again
 833:FreeRTOS/src/tasks.c ****             * if our state changed again during the reacquisition. */
