3906:FreeRTOS/src/tasks.c ****          * 2. Now a context switch causes another task to run, and the other
3907:FreeRTOS/src/tasks.c ****          *    task uses the same variable. The other task will see the variable
3908:FreeRTOS/src/tasks.c ****          *    as zero because the variable has not yet been updated by the
